{"screen_name": "azami039", "file": "azami039", "name": "甘味屋しのぶ", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1719005348487639040/PL6HBNRt.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/747904634/1762916645/1500x500", "description": "キャラクターイラストを描くのが大好き。艦これとゲームと夕雲型とギザ歯が大好き。http://skeb.jp/@azami039 pixivFANBOX http://fw24ycdb.fanbox.cc/posts", "total_works": 194, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2025-10-18T04:39:59.001473+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-14T05:31:42.237233+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 10000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-18T12:39:59.001473"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 10000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 10000, "max": 10000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/azami039", "name": "azami039"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://fw24ycdb.fanbox.cc", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/5482248", "name": "5482248"}], "flags": {"from_archive": true}, "works": [{"path": "/@azami039/works/194", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2b3779bc/uploads/origins/1dfa7375-9eef-4980-9ba5-b94c1c4b1298?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=294e382eeefcef141e2220884f4aec73", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2b3779bc/uploads/origins/1dfa7375-9eef-4980-9ba5-b94c1c4b1298?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=294e382eeefcef141e2220884f4aec73, https://si.imgix.net/2b3779bc/uploads/origins/1dfa7375-9eef-4980-9ba5-b94c1c4b1298?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb3f2cc1f2795d42fea2b06551bc8b3e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2b3779bc/uploads/origins/1dfa7375-9eef-4980-9ba5-b94c1c4b1298?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6716936d5f77042cf3229eb43d90ad45 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "『学ラン白スクチアガール艦娘』\n\n【キャラクター】\n艦隊これくしょん：お好きな艦娘でお願いします\n\n【衣装】\n白のスクール水着+学ラン+ポンポン+黒のニーソックス\n\n【状況詳細】\nシチュエーション・ポーズはお任せでお願いします。\n\n衣装は白のスクール水着の上に学ランを羽織る感じで。学ランは袖を通すだけでボタンは締めてません。両手にポンポンを持ってます。足には黒のニーソックス履いてます。\nスク水のデザイン、その他の装飾などはお任せします。\n\n以上となります。\nご一考して頂ければ幸いです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@azami039/works/193", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b746b9cc/uploads/origins/0c4addfa-fd89-43fe-881d-2618dfa14ca0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b2756f3cd1f54eee2144e01cedb0c8aa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b746b9cc/uploads/origins/0c4addfa-fd89-43fe-881d-2618dfa14ca0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b2756f3cd1f54eee2144e01cedb0c8aa, https://si.imgix.net/b746b9cc/uploads/origins/0c4addfa-fd89-43fe-881d-2618dfa14ca0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ee3a8d5164854fcf93f77559e16f4720 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b746b9cc/uploads/origins/0c4addfa-fd89-43fe-881d-2618dfa14ca0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ed630404deac1d284debde0b1bae2594 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@azami039/works/192", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/feaceba7/uploads/origins/c22c8fa9-3cc8-4257-b598-edc06ffeeac6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8bef72ae0e1eae1e31752f5d6c0e42a8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/feaceba7/uploads/origins/c22c8fa9-3cc8-4257-b598-edc06ffeeac6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bol